<title>ISRAEL: Elbit Systems wins $8.3 million order.</title>
<headline>Elbit Systems wins $8.3 million order.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Elbit Systems Ltd said on Monday it had won an $8.27 million order for avionics systems fur use on F-16 fighter jets.</p>
<p>The order, which was won by Elbit's wholly owned EFW Inc subsidiary in Forth Worth, Texas, is from Lockheed Martin.</p>
<p>The order is for 200 systems for delivery starting in July 1998 and would take three years to complete, Elbit said.</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
